    {
     "kind": "title1",
     "text": "Inside forms and documents",
     "x": 4720,
     "y": 5840
    },
    {
     "kind": "title1",
     "text": "In other workspaces",
     "x": 4720,
     "y": 7140
    },
    {
     "kind": "note",
     "text": "Nothing of Vane is in the app yet: these follow the handover spec, changed where the app differs.\n\nNew here: the full plan (the handover drew only VAT), Give Vane a job with Start, Done with what people did next, Muted with reasons, and the four undrawn states.\n\nEvery card names its template and opens What I read: the report templates and the question Vane ran.",
     "x": 15360,
     "y": 3400
    },
    {
     "kind": "note",
     "text": "Vane reads through report templates, so What I read always opens a real view.\n\nIn the builder it writes in Steps when it can and in SQL when it needs a join (Steps cannot join). The block carries an accent line until someone keeps it; saving the report is still Save.",
     "x": 7760,
     "y": 4700
    },
    {
     "kind": "note",
     "text": "The handover left Vane inside forms and documents undrawn. Here: changes drafted from answers, kept one by one, joining the form’s draft until someone publishes it.\n\nDraft records need a “made by Vane” mark: createdById points at people today. That is in the migration, waiting for your yes.",
     "x": 9280,
     "y": 6140
    },
    {
     "kind": "note",
     "text": "Each workspace gets its own templates; every send, order and work order is a person’s press.\n\nFitters see only their own visits and quotes. The CRM lets a rep read the whole pipeline today, so this needs your decision.",
     "x": 9750,
     "y": 7440
    }
   ]
